  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>親愛的倖存者們，歡迎。</strong></span> <br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否玩過<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">突變野獸模組</a>，卻對那些醜陋的綠色突變殭屍感到厭倦？</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你喜歡我的資源包<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-18\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Tissou's Zombie Pack</strong></a>，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">那麼這個就是為你準備的！</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>運行，我為你帶來遊戲中突變殭屍的全新視覺體驗。擁有<strong>超過30種新紋理</strong>的TZP Plus基於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">突變野獸模組</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chumbanotz</a>創建，主要開發者為</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">shcott21。</span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/988657970063765554/2022-06-21_05.19.36.png\" alt=\"Pic1\" width=\"926\" height=\"521\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">請記住，你需要<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Optifine</strong></a>&nbsp;以及當然的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">突變野獸模組</a>才能充分體驗我的紋理包😄</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/988657970520948786/2022-06-21_05.20.23.png\" alt=\"pic2\" width=\"918\" height=\"516\"></span>再次，我要向<span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chumbanotz</a>致敬，他基於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\">shcott21的</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">突變生物模組</a>重現了這個驚人的模組。</span><br><br><em>請勿盜用，或保留作者資訊。😊</em></span></p>",
